   "text": "\n<div id=\"bld\" hidden>\n<div class=\"top\"><div class=\"brand\"><b><span class=\"bt0\"><span class=\"bt1\">Character </span>Builder</span></b><span>PHB 2024</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"lvhead\" data-lvup=\"1\"><span>Level Up</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"b-toSheet\" class=\"tosheet\">Apply to Sheet</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"b-close\" class=\"bclose\" aria-label=\"Close builder\" title=\"Close builder\"></button></div><nav class=\"steps\" id=\"steps\"></nav></div>\n<main><div class=\"bnm\" id=\"nameRow\"><label for=\"nmIn\">Character Name</label><input class=\"btx\" id=\"nmIn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div id=\"body\"></div></main>\n<div class=\"foot\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"prev\"><span>Prev</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"next\"><span>Next</span></button></div>\n<div class=\"exp\" id=\"exp\" hidden><div class=\"expb\"><h3>Export to Character Sheet</h3><p class=\"fd\">Copy this text. In the character sheet, open Edit, scroll to Import build, paste, then Apply.</p><textarea id=\"expTxt\" readonly></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"expClose\">Close</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pri\" id=\"expCopy\">Copy</button></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"btoast\" id=\"btoast\" role=\"status\"></div>\n</div>\n"
